Zung SDS depression-awareness analysis pipeline

Single R script that takes the raw survey export and writes every published
table and figure: cleaning and scoring, reliability and item analysis,
exploratory factor analysis, non-parametric group comparisons, multivariable
linear and logistic models with full assumption diagnostics, and the awareness
composite.

Individual-level data are excluded from the repository (see data/README.md);
outputs/ carries the 48 aggregate tables and 19 figures.
